    "assignment": "Build a diagram that shows an end-to-end request journey through multiple services, and how tracing data from those services is collected and stored. Your design must include an API Gateway entry point, a multi-hop path reaching Service C, and a Tracing Collector that receives spans from all services and persists them to trace storage. Avoid connecting the client directly to backend services."
